    "text": "Hi Nova, I've found some flights from SKA to SKE on 2026-12-07. There are two options:\n\n1. Flight SA257: Departing from SKA at 06:15, arriving at SKE at 08:20. Price: 79 (Saver), 119 (Flex), 218 (Business).\n2. Flight SA258: Departing from SKA at 09:40, arriving at SKE at 10:35. Price: 189 (Saver), 229 (Flex), 438 (Business).\n\nWhich one would you like to book?",
